      "type": "multiple-choice",
      "difficulty": "knowledge-check",
      "stem": "Expand $3(x + 4)$.",
      "options": [
        { "id": "a", "text": "$3x + 4$" },
        { "id": "b", "text": "$3x + 12$" },
        { "id": "c", "text": "$3x + 7$" },
        { "id": "d", "text": "$x + 12$" }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "b",
      "explanation": "Multiply each term inside the bracket by $3$: $3 \\times x = 3x$ and $3 \\times 4 = 12$, giving $3x + 12$."
